{
  "name": "Support triage: Reflex decides",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reflex decides, n8n routes\n**Ask Reflex** sends the ticket to EuLLM's `/v1/systemone` with three questions; **Route** reads the probabilities it answers with.\n\nBefore publishing: in **Ask Reflex**, set the URL to your EuLLM server and create the **Header Auth** credential: Name `X-Api-Key`, Value your EuLLM key.\n\nReplace each branch with what your team uses: a message, a ticket, an email.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "6146baf8-79b1-5ffd-addd-c5444ef7dc5c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "eullm-triage",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "responseData": "firstEntryJson",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b66469a9-73b6-521f-95d0-b606c929f946",
      "name": "Ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "09d86ca1-a03f-5ebd-a129-905aa58f69de"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:11434/v1/systemone",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"state\": {{ JSON.stringify({ from: $json.body.from, subject: $json.body.subject, message: $json.body.message }) }},\n  \"questions\": {\n    \"team\": {\n      \"type\": \"choice\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Which team should handle this ticket?\",\n      \"criteria\": {\n        \"billing\": \"invoices, charges, refunds, payment methods, changes of plan\",\n        \"technical\": \"bugs, errors, crashes, notes not syncing, the app or the API not working\",\n        \"account\": \"signing in, passwords, two-factor authentication, lost phones, changing or closing an account\",\n        \"sales\": \"quotes, plans for teams and companies, discounts, partnerships\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"blocked\": {\n      \"type\": \"noul\",\n      \"instructions\": \"The customer is blocked or has a deadline today.\"\n    },\n    \"person\": {\n      \"type\": \"noul\",\n      \"instructions\": \"A person must handle this ticket: it threatens legal action, or says that someone else may have got into the account or seen its notes.\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "1e2004d9-44d9-5272-8f3a-56fad0f8e114",
      "name": "Ask Reflex",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
